<title>UK: SOCCER-BIRMINGHAM WITHDRAW FROM NDLOVU SIGNING.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BIRMINGHAM WITHDRAW FROM NDLOVU SIGNING.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Birmingham City decided not to sign Coventry's Peter Ndlovu on Thursday after the Zimbabwe international failed his medical.</p>
<p>&quot;The results of the medical were conveyed to the manager Trevor Francis first thing this morning and he has made a decision not to persue his interest any further,&quot; a Birmingham spokesman said.</p>
</text>
